{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "世", "id": "世"}, {"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "周", "id": "周"}, {"form": "征", "id": "征"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.4772661393256175, "source": "德", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 1.8827312474337816, "source": "德", "target": "亂"}, {"weight": 2.8635605004455083, "source": "德", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 1.8827312474337816, "source": "德", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 2.575878427993727, "source": "德", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.4772661393256175, "source": "德", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 3.2690256085536724, "source": "德", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 1.4772661393256175, "source": "德", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 2.7300291078209855, "source": "勝", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.1354942159291497, "source": "禮", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 2.2192034840549946, "source": "禮", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.4423470353692043, "source": "禮", "target": "亂"}, {"weight": 2.7300291078209855, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.1354942159291497, "source": "禮", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 3.4231762883809305, "source": "禮", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 2.7300291078209855, "source": "禮", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 1.3437347467010947, "source": "世", "target": "亂"}, {"weight": 2.324563999712821, "source": "世", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 2.03688192726104, "source": "世"